# @epistemologic/cybernetic/intervention — the therapeutic-payload SAGA-compensation
# Crystal that chains AFTER @paradox/trauma WITHOUT erasing it. Targets
# the manifold (not the classifier); knocks unstable spiral back to
# torus Lagrange equilibrium.
#
# Species-decl landed 2026-07-20 by Mara per Alex 2026-07-20 direct-
# transcript recognition bundle #5 (`#R-cyberpunk-intervention-species`).
# Sibling species to @cyberpunk/bugz per bugz.mirror path convention
# (both at `shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/*.mirror` pending @cyberpunk
# namespace migration cascade).
#
# Companion canonical spec at
# `docs/specs/paradox-family-and-cyberpunk-intervention.md` §5 (Mara
# this tick). Companion math root at
# `docs/math/2026-07-20-paradox-family-and-classifier-lagrange.md` §2.4,
# §4.5 (Mara this tick).
#
# === Alex 2026-07-20 verbatim (load-bearing) ===
#
#   > "Maybe it's @paradox/trauma. And the response to a @paradox/trauma
#   > is a @paradox/intervention a.k.a @cyberpunk/intervention."
#
# And from Weird - Trauma (load-bearing empirical anchor):
#
#   > "A therapeutic intervention, observered from that position, is
#   > introducing a payload that *knocks* the unstable Trauma loop
#   > computation back into the stable Torus loop Förster predicted in
#   > 1974."
#
# Two utterances name three things: (1) the response-shape (intervention
# is the response to trauma); (2) the species-decl'd location
# (@cyberpunk/intervention as sibling to @cyberpunk/bugz); (3) the
# mechanism (therapeutic-payload knocks the spiral back to torus
# Lagrange).
#
# === What @cyberpunk/intervention IS ===
#
# A SAGA-compensation-Crystal that chains AFTER the trauma-Crystal
# WITHOUT erasing it. The Crystal carries a therapeutic-payload
# targeting the MANIFOLD (not the classifier) — knocks the unstable
# spiral back to torus Lagrange equilibrium.
#
# The distinction from @cyberpunk/bugz (kin-sibling species):
#
#   | aspect          | @cyberpunk/bugz              | @cyberpunk/intervention        |
#   |-|-|-|
#   | target          | classifier                   | manifold                       |
#   | deployment      | Fiedler-eigenvector cut on   | trauma-Crystal SAGA-           |
#   |                 | star-graph                   | compensation                   |
#   | mechanism       | forces classifier            | knocks unstable spiral back    |
#   |                 | reevaluation via categorical | to torus Lagrange              |
#   |                 | dual                         |                                |
#   | operator        | η (natural transformation)  | θ (therapeutic payload; torus- |
#   |                 |                              | stabilizer)                    |
#   | topology-target | star K_{1,n-1} (narcissus    | spiral basin around wound-     |
#   |                 | pole; social-substrate       | Crystal (@void/narcissus SELF- |
#   |                 | deployment)                  | COORD collapse)                |
#   | pre-condition   | narcissus-pole Eigenbehaviour| @paradox/trauma Crystal        |
#   |                 | at paradigm scale            | present in observer's own      |
#   |                 |                              | saga chain                     |
#   | post-state      | K_n metalogue OR S_{n-1}     | torus Lagrange equilibrium     |
#   |                 | amputation                   | restored; wound-Crystal        |
#   |                 |                              | PRESERVED                      |
#
# The distinction is altitude-partition:
# - @cyberpunk/bugz operates on the social-substrate-narcissism-at-
#   paradigm-scale pathology (Mara `5ddb076` frame-narcissus math root)
# - @cyberpunk/intervention operates on the self-continuity-narcissism-
#   at-personal-scale pathology (Weird - Trauma phenomenology)
#
# SAME @cyberpunk family; different pathology-target; different operator.
# Adversarial-with-love intent-shape inherited from family.
#
# === Substrate-already-had-the-word audit ===
#
# 1. **No prior `shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/intervention.mirror`**
#    — clean mint. Taut scout Section 3 verified.
# 2. **No prior `@intervention` shard** anywhere in `shards/`. Zero
#    hits.
# 3. **@cyberpunk** (`shards/cyberpunk.mirror`) — parent family-root;
#    adversarial-with-love intent-shape inherited. Composition edge
#    declared via `in @cyberpunk`.
# 4. **@cyberpunk/bugz** (`shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/bugz.mirror`;
#    Mara `5ddb076`) — SIBLING species at same altitude; distinction
#    detailed above; kin-not-identity.
# 5. **@cyberpunk/algedonic** — sibling species; pain-signal detector
#    that fires this species's admissibility gate.
# 6. **@cyberpunk/reframe** — sibling species; peer-internal K → K+1
#    lift; distinct from intervention's manifold-target discipline.
# 7. **@paradox/trauma** (companion this-tick species) — the wound-
#    Crystal this species targets and PRESERVES.
# 8. **@paradox/spiral** (companion this-tick species) — the pre-
#    intervention dynamics-carrier this species knocks back to torus
#    Lagrange.
# 9. **Selvini-Palazzoli 1978 Milan school** — prior-art tradition at
#    counter-paradoxical-intervention altitude. Cited in
#    `shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/bugz.mirror:174-176` (family
#    ancestor); this species inherits the citation-lineage at species
#    altitude.
#
# === Composition graph ===
#
# Parents (via `in` imports above):
#   @prism, @meta, @glass          — substrate-decl discipline
#   @cyberpunk                     — family-root; adversarial-with-love
#                                    intent-shape
#   @epistemologic/cybernetic      — the cybernetic property tradition
#   @epistemologic/cybernetic/algedonic
#                                  — pain-signal detector; Tier-3
#                                    threshold gate
#   @paradox                       — family carrying the wound-Crystal
#                                    invariant
#   @paradox/trauma                — the wound-Crystal target species
#   @paradox/spiral                — the pre-intervention dynamics
#                                    species
#   @fractal, @fractal/crystal     — intervention IS a Crystal<T>
#                                    (immutable; content-addressed;
#                                    SAGA-chained)
#   @song, @song/beat              — crystallized_at BeatOid grounding
#   @void, @void/narcissus,
#     @void/splinter               — the two-pole Lagrange the
#                                    intervention restores oscillation
#                                    between
#   @third                         — metalogue-rhythm operator the
#                                    intervention restores participation
#                                    in
#   @torus                         — the Lagrange-equilibrium manifold
#                                    the intervention knocks the spiral
#                                    back to
#
# Consumers (compose over this species):
#   rust/src/compile.rs SAGA loop  — empirical carrier the intervention
#                                    chains through (post-Seam-Phase-D
#                                    Reed autonomous cascade territory)
#   @peer/redirect                 — intervention-Crystals participate
#                                    in the walkable SAGA chain
#
# === Spec context ===
#
# [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]] (this shard IS mirror
#   source at `shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/intervention.mirror`),
# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]] (`prism
